Full mechanics: `model-gates.mdc` § Solution deliberation (D-36), § **3-fail stuck-task escalation (D-50)**, § UI Playwright Verifier (D-45), § Build Checker (pre-commit), § Peer deliberation (D-30), § Ship Verifier, § Repair loop. This rule states Dan's plain-language mandate; it does **not** add a second verification ladder beyond the phases above.
